  "description": "Generate an n x n matrix filled with elements from 1 to n^2 in spiral order.",
  "target": 3,
  "pseudocode": "1. matrix = Array(n).fill().map(() => Array(n))\n2. top=0, bottom=n-1, left=0, right=n-1, num=1\n3. while num <= n*n\n4. for i from left to right: matrix[top][i] = num++\n5. top++\n6. for i from top to bottom: matrix[i][right] = num++\n7. right--\n8. for i from right down to left: matrix[bottom][i] = num++\n9. bottom--\n10. for i from bottom down to top: matrix[i][left] = num++\n11. left++",
